    "title": "Warsaw Man Sentenced In Battery Case - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By in Breaking News ,\n9 hours ago WARSAW — A Warsaw man was sentenced after acting inappropriately with an individual during a job interview. Robert Paul Levelle, 37, 2562 Walton Blvd. No. 320, Warsaw, pled guilty to battery, a class B misdemeanor; and making an unlawful proposition, a class A misdemeanor. Charges of sexual battery and criminal confinement were dismissed. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
